        "title": "Add warning to runterminalcommand system prompt",
        "summary": "Added a warning to the `run_terminal_command` tool description in `backend/src/system-prompt.ts`. The warning instructs the model to use the tool sparingly, avoid running commands beyond what the user asked for, and be careful with commands that could have permanent effects. This change is internal and affects the backend system prompt.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-15T17:18:15.472Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "When the assistant runs commands in your terminal, it now also sees a reminder added to its instructions that says to use that capability sparingly, only when truly needed, and to be more cautious with commands that could change or delete things. This only affects how the assistant behaves internally when it decides to run terminal commands on your behalf.",
