        "v": 5,
        "title": "Add Other use cases tips doc",
        "summary": "Added web/src/content/tips/other-use-cases.mdx with 108 lines of example commands for Code Review, Git Workflow, Codebase Questions, Script Generation, Documentation, Configuration, and SQL. Covers non-coding workflows via natural language prompts. Includes tips for better results and knowledge.md usage.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "at": "2026-09-15T17:18:23.220Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "A new help page was added that shows example questions you can ask the assistant, like writing a commit message, explaining how authentication works, or generating a script to calculate monthly churn. It also includes tips for getting better results, such as being specific about which files you're working with and using knowledge files to teach the assistant about your project's patterns. You would see this as a new section of guidance documents alongside existing tips.",
